#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-default-versions.rst:11
msgid "Default versions of dependencies"
msgstr "依赖的默认版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-default-versions.rst:13
msgid ""
"Read the Docs supports any documentation tool to build your documentation. "
"However, we provide pre-defined builders for `Sphinx <https://www.sphinx-"
"doc.org/>`__ and `MkDocs <https://www.mkdocs.org/>`__."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 支持使用任何文档工具构建文档。不过，我们为 `Sphinx <https://www.sphinx-doc.org/>`__"
" 和 `MkDocs <https://www.mkdocs.org/>`__ 提供了预定义的构建器。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-default-versions.rst:17
msgid ""
"In the past we used to install several dependencies to a specific version "
"and update them after some time, but doing so would break some builds and "
"make it more difficult for new projects to use new versions. For this "
"reason, we are now installing just the minimal required dependencies using "
"their latest version by default. You can see the full list of historical "
"dependencies and advice for migrating in our `blog post "
"<https://blog.readthedocs.com/defaulting-latest-build-tools/>`__ announcing "
"this change."
msgstr ""
"过去我们会将若干依赖固定到特定版本，并在一段时间后更新它们，但这样做会导致某些构建失败，并让新项目更难使用新版本。因此，我们现在默认仅安装最新版本的最小必要依赖。完整的历史依赖列表与迁移建议，请参阅我们宣布此变更的"
" `博客文章 <https://blog.readthedocs.com/defaulting-latest-build-tools/>`__。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/build-default-versions.rst:24
msgid ""
"In order to keep your builds reproducible, it's highly recommended declaring"
" its dependencies and versions explicitly. See :doc:`/guides/reproducible-"
"builds`."
msgstr "为保持构建可复现，强烈建议显式声明依赖及其版本。请参阅 :doc:`/guides/reproducible-builds`。"

